{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 12, :comments ["<b>ירבה</b> — יגדל [it is great]. The sense is: you say that El is greater than man, and his meaning is, therefore — because you are not righteous — I will answer you, to show you the greatness of the Place."], :book :job, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 33, :notes {0 "Resolved 'המקום' ('the Place') as a divine epithet left untranslated per the convention of preserving Ibn Ezra's terminology; it refers to God."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Job -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/eyov/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:04:19.960423488Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}